          "description": "Model = sia at the margin cell (27,15): the east neighbor (28,15) is ice-free (mask 0), so the x-derivative stencil is one-sided (east weight 0, west 1; D_x = 1/dx) -- the C++ margin switch of StressBalance::compute_vertical_velocity. The east staggered point (27,15,0) carries the BedSmoother trace theta = 0.5; the other three staggered points have theta = 1. Asserted values are the stage1/dumps/sia columns at cell (27,15) and at the staggered point (27,15,0).",
